t-adv-heading55_89af5e-eb wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-3-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading55_89af5e-eb">Einer der wichtigsten Anbieter von Futtermittelzusatzstoffen in China</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Über unseren designierten Produktionspartner bietet Dinweys Biotech internationalen Kunden hochwertige Futtermittelzusatzstoffe an, darunter <a href="/de/produkt/cholinchlorid-60/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="1" title="Cholinchlorid 60% Futtermittelzusatzstoff - Maiskolbenträger China Hersteller Versorgung">Cholinchlorid</a>, <a href="/product_category/vitamins/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="2" title="Vitamine">Vitamine</a>, Mineralien, Aminosäuren und Futterenzympräparate.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Wir koordinieren die Lieferplanung, die Exportverfahren und die technische Unterstützung, um eine stabile Lieferung weltweit zu gewährleisten.</p><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column55_b002cb-b2 kb-section-dir-horizontal"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column55_ada150-5d"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kt-adv-heading55_c19895-f3 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading55_c19895-f3">20+</div><div class="kt-adv-heading55_28c32b-c3 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-5-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading55_28c32b-c3">Länder Export nach</div></div></div><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column55_70d9e6-c2"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kt-adv-heading55_b37a6e-49 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-1-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading55_b37a6e-49">100+</div><div class="kt-adv-heading55_15320f-23 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-5-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading55_15320f-23">Kunden auf der ganzen Welt</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id55_c2e624-f3 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column55_4972b6-f1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
